  "description": "With 24-inch wheels and 120mm travel, the META HT 24 is perfect for young riders who are still growing and looking for the ideal bike to work on their skills.\n• Up front, the MANITOU Junit 32 Comp fork has been specially developed in collaboration with the American brand to offer maximum sensitivity and comfort for young riders.\n• The TEKTRO HD-J2820 brakes with 180 and 160mm rotors provide a sharp feel and precise braking, perfect for stopping lighter riders.\n• ALEXRIMS MD30 wheels ensure reliability and strength.\n• The MICROSHIFT Advent X 10-speed drivetrain features a wide 11–48t range. It is reliable and precise for linking up trails with ease. For better ergonomics, the cranks have been shortened to 140mm.",
